  "Seed_Compilation_Status": "Successful",
  "Trigger_Explanation": "The test triggers the bug by calling the showBug method on an instance of Child. The showBug method compares the equality of a Parent object and a Child object in both directions, which should return false due to the non-symmetric equals method implementation.",
